---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import T from '../components/ui/T.astro';
import Lede from '../components/ui/Lede.astro';
import CubesInCube from '../components/viz/CubesInCube.tsx';
import '../styles/paper.css';
---
<Base file="cubes.html" title="Cubes in a Cube">
<Lede en="The optimal packings of 9 and 10 unit cubes in the cube of side 2 + 1/√2. Drag to turn." ja="辺 2 + 1/√2 の立方体に単位立方体 9 個・10 個を入れる最適な配置。ドラッグで回す。"><p class="note"><T en="s₃(n) is the side of the smallest cube that holds n unit cubes with pairwise disjoint interiors (any positions, any orientations). The packings are those of Erich Friedman's Packing Center (Cubes in Cubes), drawn from the exact coordinates in Q(√2) of problems/cubes-in-cube/upper/configs.py. The lower bound: every closed unit cube in [0, s]³ contains one of the 8 points V = {1, s − 1}³, so 9 cubes do not fit in a smaller cube." ja="s₃(n) は、内部が互いに交わらない単位立方体 n 個（位置・向きは自由）が入る最小の立方体の辺。配置は Erich Friedman の Packing Center（Cubes in Cubes）のもので、problems/cubes-in-cube/upper/configs.py の Q(√2) の厳密な座標から描く。下界：[0, s]³ の中の閉じた単位立方体はどれも 8 点 V = {1, s − 1}³ のどれかを含むので、それより小さい立方体に 9 個は入らない。" /></p></Lede>
<div data-l="en"><CubesInCube client:load /></div>
<div data-l="ja"><CubesInCube lang="ja" client:load /></div>
<p class="links-inline"><a class="btn" href="paper-cubes-in-cube.html"><T en="The proof: s₃(9) = s₃(10) = 2 + 1/√2" ja="証明：s₃(9) = s₃(10) = 2 + 1/√2" /></a> <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/wand125/square-packing/tree/main/problems/cubes-in-cube">problems/cubes-in-cube/</a> <a class="btn" href="paper-cubes-n-dim.html"><T en="Two unit 4-cubes: s₄(2) = 2" ja="単位 4 次元立方体 2 個：s₄(2) = 2" /></a></p>
</Base>
